@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 9: PUT /api/v1/refunds/:id/items (El vendedor corrige la nota en EDITING)

actor "Vendedor" as Seller
participant "App Ventas / Web" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Order Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_order_details DB" as DetailsDB
participant "refund_order_detail_sources DB" as SourcesDB

Seller -> App: Recorta cantidades de la nota disociada (o devuelta por el revisor)
App -> Gateway: PUT /api/v1/refunds/1004/items\n(EditRefundItemsDto: { items: [{ detailId, quantity, notes }], justification })
Gateway -> Service: editRefundOrderItems(refundOrderId: 1004, payload, actor)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findRefundOrderWithInstance(1004)
OrdersDB --> Service: order { status: 'OPEN', document_type: 'DISSOCIATED',\ncurrent_workflow_instance_id: 56 }

Service -> InstanceDB: 2. findInstance(56)
InstanceDB --> Service: instance { status: 'EDITING', current_level_order: NULL }

Service -> DetailsDB: 3. findActiveDetails(1004)
DetailsDB --> Service: details[] (source_quantity, quantity, price_unit)

Service -> Service: 4. assertEditable(order, instance, actor, payload)
note right of Service
  409 si instance.status != 'EDITING':
  una nota en aprobación no se edita
  409 si order.edit_count >= 1: el tope de
  negocio es una sola corrección por nota
  403 si el actor no es el vendedor dueño
  de la nota ni de su distribuidora
  422 si quantity > source_quantity — el CHECK
  de la tabla exige 0 <= quantity <= source_quantity
  422 si todas las líneas quedan en 0
end note

Service -> Service: 5. recomputeTotal(payload.items)
note right of Service
  total = SUM(quantity * price_unit)
  price_unit NUNCA se toca: quedó congelado
  al momento del reclamo.
end note

Service -> TX: 6. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> DetailsDB: 7. updateDetailQuantities(1004, payload.items)
note right of DetailsDB
  Solo baja quantity y notes.
  source_quantity se mantiene como techo
  y evidencia de lo que se recibió.
end note
DetailsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> SourcesDB: 8. adjustDetailSources(detailIds, payload.items)
note right of SourcesDB
  Al recortar la línea hay que recortar sus
  orígenes: la suma de sources.quantity tiene
  que seguir dando quantity.
end note
SourcesDB --> Service: ok

Service -> OrdersDB: 9. updateRefundOrder(1004, total, justification, editCount + 1)
note right of OrdersDB
  edit_count = edit_count + 1.
  Es el contador que hace exigible la regla
  de "una sola corrección".
end note
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 10. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

note right of Service
  La edición no genera acción de workflow:
  el movimiento se registra recién al
  reenviar (SELLER_RESUBMITTED), con
  amount_before y amount_after.
end note

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (EditRefundItemsResult: { refundOrderId, total })
Gateway --> App: 200 OK
App --> Seller: Cambios guardados • La nota sigue en edición hasta que la reenvíe
@enduml
